  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_aprl",
      "name": {
        "en": "April's Badge",
        "zh": "四月证章",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "original",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator April has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for maintaining distance whilst conducting suppressive fire against the enemy.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Sniper Operator during field operations to exercise Marksman responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员四月擅长保持距离对敌人进行火力压制\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为狙击干员，行使速射手职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_aprl",
      "name": {
        "en": "Hi-Fi Headset",
        "zh": "高保真通讯耳机",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "Y",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_aprl",
      "description": {
        "en": "April climbs onto the roof.\nThe school is deserted at night, seeming to acquiesce to her intrusion. The vast streets can be seen from the roof of this building, as well as the spotlights shone skyward from the gym several blocks out. Unlike Rim Billiton, there's no stench of slag on the evening breeze, nor the dust Rhodes Island so often faces in storms while sailing the wilds. It's clean, and strange for it.\nHer field mission concluded two hours ago. She made sure to put on her favorite band's bracelet as she set out from the Rhodes office. Had a whole disguise on and everything. Still got stopped outside the venue. 'Our tickets aren't for sale to the Infected. We need to ensure the safety of our other concertgoers,' the worker said, while taking a cautious step back. 'Sorry.'\n<i>Yeah, figures I'd get caught,</i> she ruefully thinks, stood below the looming white gymnasium walls. Infected have their own neighborhoods, their own perimeter walls, and their own checkpoints. Rhodes Island spent a week of classes teaching her that Oripathy wasn't something you could transmit just by brushing past someone else, but it's not like she can teach the whole city that.\nOh well. She's on the roof, right here, right now. She takes off her headphones.\nRhythmic cheers and shrieks pour out of the circular venue, indistinct by the time they reach her ears. They're a lot like the calls she used to hear from the mines. In this moment, they echo the beat of her heart. She reaches a hand out towards the spotlights in the sky, almost able to feel the air shaking. Even though that concert venue all bedazzled with lights feels as far away as the moon.\nIn that sea of noise, an extremely familiar intro faintly reaches her, every note mixed in with the city's clamor.\nShe needs to be careful. She can't get spotted. But she still waves her braceleted hand in time with the music, lightly singing as she does.\n<i>So lucky I got to apply for this field mission, seriously,</i> she thinks.",
        "zh": "四月攀上房顶。\n晚间的学校空无一人，似乎默许她擅自潜入。从这座建筑的天台可以望见宽阔的街道，还有数个街区外体育馆打向天空的射灯。夜风中没有雷姆必拓矿渣的异味，也没有罗德岛在荒野上行驶时会迎面撞上的沙尘，干净而陌生。\n两个小时之前她结束外勤任务，从罗德岛办事处出发时特意戴上了自己最爱的乐队的手环，补了补妆，结果被拦在了演出的园区外面。“为保障其他观演人员的安全，我们的演唱会门票不对感染者出售。”工作人员说话时小心地后退了一步，“抱歉。”\n被抓到了就没办法了呀。在体育馆高高的白墙下，她遗憾地想。感染者有自己的街区，自己的围墙和检查口。罗德岛用一周的课程培训教会她矿石病并不会因为与人擦肩而过就传染，但她没办法教给这座城市。\n不过没关系。此刻她坐在天台上，摘下耳机。\n有节奏的欢呼与尖叫漫出环形的场馆，模糊不清地传到她的耳中，好像过去她途经矿场时听到的口号声，却能应和她此刻怦怦的心跳。她向着射灯闪烁的夜空伸出手，几乎能触摸到空气在振动，即使那灯火辉煌的演唱会场馆远得像一轮月亮。\n声浪中，隐约响起她耳熟能详的前奏，每一个音都混在城市前行的噪声里。\n她需要小心，不能被人发现，但她还是随着音乐挥舞起戴着手环的手臂，轻轻唱出了声。\n这次的外勤任务能申请下来真是太幸运了，她想。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ],
